Description: Tetrad Studio: Russian Reader, List Trainer and OPI Memory Tool
 Offline Russian study tools in their own windows: a leveled reader with
 tap-to-learn, a flashcard trainer, and an OPI practice tool with a worked
 example. Progress is kept in ~/.local/share/russian-study-tools.
